sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    actor F as Finance desk
    participant W as Portal
    participant FI as finance-service
    participant K as Kafka

    S->>W: Pay online, then Pay by UPI
    W->>FI: GET /api/fees/upi/config
    FI-->>W: the institute's UPI id (empty means UPI is off)
    W->>W: a QR code from upi://pay for the amount chosen
    S->>S: pays from their own UPI app, copies the transaction reference (UTR)
    S->>FI: POST /api/fees/upi/claims (plan, amount, UTR)
    FI->>FI: own plan only, amount not more than is owed, UTR shape checked, one claim per UTR
    FI->>K: notify the finance desk (UPI payment to check)

    F->>FI: GET /api/fees/upi/claims, find the UTR in the bank statement
    alt found
        F->>FI: POST /api/fees/upi/claims/{id}/confirm
        FI->>FI: record an ordinary UPI payment (receipt number, refuses a closed period)
        FI->>K: receipt email with the PDF
        FI->>FI: claim CONFIRMED with the payment id
    else not found
        F->>FI: POST /api/fees/upi/claims/{id}/reject (reason)
        FI->>K: notify the student (UPI payment not found)
    end
